---
title: "Baton — UML State Diagram: Pipeline Event Lifecycle"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> received : Webhook arrives

    received --> processing : WebhookWorker picks up
    processing --> matched : Rule(s) found &amp; conditions pass
    processing --> no_match : No matching rules
    processing --> failed : Extraction or matching error

    matched --> launching : LauncherWorker picks up
    launching --> completed : Maestro instance created
    launching --> retry : Maestro API error (transient)
    launching --> failed : Max retries exceeded

    retry --> launching : Retry after delay<br/>(linear / exponential)

    no_match --> [*] : Pipeline ends<br/>(logged, no action)
    completed --> [*] : Pipeline ends<br/>(notification sent)
    failed --> [*] : Pipeline ends<br/>(error notification sent)

    state received {
        [*] --> signature_verify
        signature_verify --> store_raw : Valid signature
        signature_verify --> rejected : Invalid signature
        store_raw --> enqueue_sqs
        rejected --> [*]
    }

    state processing {
        [*] --> extract_event
        extract_event --> find_rules
        find_rules --> evaluate_conditions
        evaluate_conditions --> map_fields : Conditions pass
    }

    state launching {
        [*] --> decrypt_tokens
        decrypt_tokens --> call_maestro
        call_maestro --> track_instance
        track_instance --> send_notification
    }
